From 21f96a838359850921d0b1a94bbd06080579bb2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 08:34:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Prose profile: the General MIDI soundfont

Haiku's own softsynth (BSynth, src/kits/midi/SoftSynth.cpp:124) loads
data/synth/TimGM6mb.sf2 from the timgmsoundfont package. The stock
regular profile asks for it, but the package does not exist for arm64 in
build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64, and the Prose profile's own
package list did not name it either.

So the image had no soundfont at all: BSynth had nothing to load and
MidiPlayer -- and every other app that plays through the internal synth
-- was silent. The only working MIDI output was the Prose MIDI port,
which sends the guest's notes to the Mac's General MIDI synth.

The package is data only (ARCHITECTURES="any", a no-op BUILD, an INSTALL
that copies one .sf2), built by HaikuArmQemu's prosepkg from the
haiku-data/timgmsoundfont recipe.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0046-prose-profile-the-general-midi-soundfont.patch 4eb04df662477307942f656b8c2f52cbbe7cb26e3914a79f4e74df39d04aa354
---
 build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles          | 4 ++++
 build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 | 1 +
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles b/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
index 466b087ba4..b20ce36e5b 100644
--- a/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
+++ b/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
@@ -216,6 +216,10 @@ rule DefineDefaultBuildProfiles
 				gzip
 				tar
 				which
+				# the General MIDI soundfont Haiku's own softsynth loads
+				# (BSynth: data/synth/TimGM6mb.sf2); without it MidiPlayer
+				# and every BSynth app are silent
+				timgmsoundfont
 				# the web browser
 				netsurf
 				# applications
diff --git a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
index 6de0bff221..87f35d8d26 100644
--- a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
+++ b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ RemotePackageRepository HaikuPorts
 	# architecture "any" packages
 	# from prose-packages (the server has no arm64 snapshot of this list)
 	ca_root_certificates-2026_07_16-1
+	timgmsoundfont-2011.12.11-1
 	noto_sans_cjk_jp-2.004-2
 	haikuporter-0_bootstrap-1
 	noto-20170202_bootstrap-7
